From c696789ae26bcddeaaf9049396541c1375e9c879 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:22:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge branch 'memreclaim' into integration

- main.ld / us.mk: mod_species.c and memreclaim's tfs_stream.c,
  npc_anim_trim.c, npc_anim_keep.c all linked;
- loadMMD (NPC class 0): the model is read through readDigimonModel
  (DIGI.DAT for new species) and then trimmed with its real size
  (getDigimonModelFileSize); trimNpcModel leaves types >= 180 alone.

The linker asserts (MIN_HEAP below the 20 KB stack, TFS ring, overlays in
the load area) hold with every merged table.

